msgid "**Notice:**"
msgstr "**注意：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/InternVL3.5.md:178
msgid "Some configurations for optimization are shown below:"
msgstr "以下是一些用于优化的配置："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/InternVL3.5.md:180
msgid ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1`: Enable FlashComm optimization to reduce "
"communication and computation overhead on prefill node. With FlashComm "
"enabled, layer_sharding list cannot include o_proj as an element."
msgstr ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1`：启用 FlashComm 优化以减少 prefill 节点上的通信和计算开销。启用 "
"FlashComm 后，layer_sharding 列表不能包含 o_proj 作为元素。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/InternVL3.5.md:181
msgid ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2`: Enable the dispatch_ffn_combine/mega_moe "
"fused operator."
msgstr "`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2`：启用 dispatch_ffn_combine/mega_moe 融合算子。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/InternVL3.5.md:182
msgid ""
"The above parameters are validated in a specific test environment for "
"reference only. Please adjust `--max-model-len`, `--max-num-seqs`, `--max-"
"num-batched-tokens`, and `--gpu-memory-utilization` based on your actual "
"input/output length, concurrency, and hardware configuration."
msgstr ""
"上述参数在特定测试环境中验证，仅供参考。请根据您的实际输入/输出长度、并发数和硬件配置调整 `--max-model-len`、`--max-num-"
"seqs`、`--max-num-batched-tokens` 和 `--gpu-memory-utilization`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/InternVL3.5.md:183
msgid ""
"For Ascend-specific options passed through `--additional-config`, refer to "
"[Additional "
"Configuration](../../user_guide/configuration/additional_config.md). For "
"Ascend-specific environment variables, refer to [Environment "
"Variables](../../user_guide/configuration/env_vars.md)."
msgstr ""
"有关通过 `--additional-config` 传递的 Ascend "
"特定选项，请参阅[附加配置](../../user_guide/configuration/additional_config.md)。有关 "
"Ascend 特定的环境变量，请参阅[环境变量](../../user_guide/configuration/env_vars.md)。"

